Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:53.60,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:53.60,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}兹维列夫 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6(4) {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6(6){\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 阿特马内 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:01.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Sasha, congratulations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨沙 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:03.12,EN,,0,0,0,,that was a lot of fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场打得很过瘾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.46,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot of respect between the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们俩之间充满了尊重
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:04.80,EN,,0,0,0,,How high
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,水平有多高
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:07.06,EN,,0,0,0,,was the level you both reached tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:07.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们今晚打出的水平？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:10.74,EN,,0,0,0,,I think really a step up from the first match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:10.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉比上一场更上一个档次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and he played amazing tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,他今天打得非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.38,EN,,0,0,0,,incredibly aggressive, served unbelievable,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得极具侵略性 发球也很凶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:17.42,EN,,0,0,0,,hit forehands all over the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,正手打得满场飞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:18.04,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, definitely happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:19.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to be through in straight sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:19.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,能直落两盘拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:21.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Your forehands had a lot of love this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:21.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的正手今年一直很受关注
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:21.86,EN,,0,0,0,,understandably,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也不难理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.02,EN,,0,0,0,,but it was the trusty back end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,但今天关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.02,0:00:25.22,EN,,0,0,0,,that got it done there at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.02,0:00:25.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,帮你赢下的是那记反手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:27.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I think it was just the shot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:27.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得那只是那一刻的一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:29.88,EN,,0,0,0,,in that moment, but overall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,但总体来说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.70,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the heaviness and the speed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,他的球又沉又快
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:33.70,EN,,0,0,0,,of his shots is extremely high,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:33.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,力量和速度都非常惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:34.86,EN,,0,0,0,,so it's definitely difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:34.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以自己想主动进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:35.94,EN,,0,0,0,,to play aggressive yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:38.26,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm happy that I managed in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:38.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我很高兴最后还是顶住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:40.48,EN,,0,0,0,,You had to come off court in the second set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘你还中途下场了一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:42.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Can you explain why, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:42.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,说说是怎么回事 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:43.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I was just sweating,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是出汗太多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:44.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I was making the whole court wet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:44.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,把整片场地都弄湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:47.64,EN,,0,0,0,,so the umpire told me to go change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,裁判让我去换身衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:49.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I was making the court so wet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:49.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 场地被我弄得太湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.24,0:00:51.10,EN,,0,0,0,,that it was impossible to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.24,0:00:51.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,都没法打了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:52.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Well done tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚打得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
